WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.190
- Did you also work on any new music?

00:00:01.190 --> 00:00:02.023
I know a lot of artists,

00:00:02.023 --> 00:00:03.014
like during the pandemic worked on.

00:00:03.014 --> 00:00:03.847
- Yes.

00:00:03.847 --> 00:00:05.330
- [Kelly] Like, I'm excited
for you to have new stuff.

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:06.163
- You know, thank you so much.

00:00:06.163 --> 00:00:06.996
- Yeah.

00:00:06.996 --> 00:00:08.180
- It was a weird, you know,

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:09.880
situation at first,
kind of trying to like,

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:11.270
I know a lot of friends of mine

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:12.462
who are artists struggled with like,

00:00:12.462 --> 00:00:15.310
some of them were more inspired than ever

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:17.130
and felt themselves like in one space,

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:18.340
being able to create.

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:20.850
And others who didn't
necessarily feel that way.

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:21.683
And I

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:27.140
found myself in that
sort of space of like,

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:29.130
this is, I finally feel
like I have the time

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:29.963
to get this right.

00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:31.740
And to tell this story

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:34.060
the way I want to sonically, lyrically.

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:36.340
And I'm very excited about this music

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:37.630
that I've been working on.

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:39.060
It's all the projects almost.

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:39.957
It's almost done.

00:00:39.957 --> 00:00:42.012
(audience cheers)

00:00:42.012 --> 00:00:43.837
I'm always so nervous to
say anything about my music

00:00:43.837 --> 00:00:44.670
'cause then they're like,

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:46.400
oh it's coming, it means
it's coming tomorrow.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:47.610
- [Kelly] I know, but
that's so cool though,

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:48.470
'cause people are excited.

00:00:48.470 --> 00:00:49.570
You have some great music.

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:50.403
- [Hailee] Thank you.

00:00:50.403 --> 00:00:51.310
- So people are stoked about it.

00:00:51.310 --> 00:00:53.340
I've always wanted to,
I mean, just personally,

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:54.501
I want to hear a singer-songwriter album

00:00:54.501 --> 00:00:56.540
from you, like really hardcore.

00:00:56.540 --> 00:00:57.444
- [Hailee] Oh my god.

00:00:57.444 --> 00:00:58.427
(audience cheers) Thank you.

00:00:58.427 --> 00:00:59.265
- [Kelly] 'Cause you're an actor,

00:00:59.265 --> 00:01:01.044
so you'd do a really
good job of storytelling.

00:01:01.044 --> 00:01:01.877
- Thank you.

00:01:01.877 --> 00:01:02.710
- Like even when it's got like a beat,

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:03.890
like I love your voice.

00:01:03.890 --> 00:01:06.030
I love those songs, but I,
at one point in your life,

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:06.984
please, for me, you just do that.

00:01:06.984 --> 00:01:07.817
- [Hailee] You got it.

00:01:07.817 --> 00:01:09.210
If you'll be on it with me.

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:10.666
- Fine. Fine. I'll do backgrounds.

00:01:10.666 --> 00:01:11.730
I love singing backgrounds.

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:12.563
- Please, oh my god.

00:01:12.563 --> 00:01:14.500
- [Kelly] Just let me do the harmonies.

